  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: part 1 (年別 昭和3-8) 34 rows; part 2 (罪種別 昭和8年) 72 rows incl. 2 heading rows (刑法犯, 特別法犯) = 70 data rows. Spread pp.320-321 (p0186) and 322-323 (p0187); the table runs over both frames and is joined across the left (totals, 農業, 水產業, 鑛業) and right (工業 … 無業) pages.",
   "Row labels: the year is printed '昭和' once then '〃' (ditto) with the year number; written here in full ('〃4年' kept as '〃4年'). Race labels 總數/內地人/本島人/蕃人/朝鮮人/外國人 as printed; 朝鮮人 row only printed when non-empty in the block. Part 2 group names (總數, 刑法犯總數, 竊盜, 強盜) are the vertical labels at the left margin of p.320; the heading '刑法犯' (top of p.322) and '特別法犯' are kept as heading rows; the 總數 block under 特別法犯 is written '特別法犯總數'. Column heading '種' / '別 (昭和8年)' printed across the break above part 2 (罪種別 (昭和8年)).",
   "Figures printed out of line with row labels (the right-hand pages are skewed): assigned by row position / tilt-corrected row order. For every row: 總數 = 男 + 女 and male (女) total = sum of the occupation columns — checked for all 104 data rows of both parts; all reconcile except the one below.",
   "Row '〃7年 總數', col '鑛業 — 男': printed 63 (read at 3x zoom as 63 with an open 3); the parts of the block (內地人 4 + 本島人 50 + 外國人 8) sum to 62, and the row's occupation columns sum to 4,008 vs printed male total 4,007 — does NOT reconcile (diff 1). Kept as printed; the printed totals would imply 62.",
   "Row '〃8年 本島人' (part 1), col '水產業 — 男': first digit 5, second digit hidden under the column rule — written '[?]' (the same cell in the repeated 昭和8年 block of part 2 reads 52; not copied).",
   "Row '〃4年 外國人', col '交通業 — 女': empty in the original (no figure, no dots) — written ''.",
   "Block totals: in every block of part 1 and in the 總數 / 刑法犯總數 / 特別法犯總數 blocks of part 2 the race rows sum to the 總數 row in every column (except the cells above); the crime rows of 刑法犯 sum to the 刑法犯總數 row and the special-law rows to the 特別法犯總數 row in every column. 總數 (3,774) = 刑法犯 2,354 + 特別法犯 1,420; male 3,543 = 2,257 + 1,286; female 231 = 97 + 134.",
   "The 昭和8年 block of part 1 and the 總數 block of part 2 agree in all cells except the [?] cell. Cells printed '...' / '..' are written '…'. 蕃人 = Aborigines row, 外國人 = foreigners."
